# Medallion Architecture

- Bronze: CSV → Delta raw tables, ingestion metadata logged
- Silver: completeness, uniqueness, referential integrity, type/business logic — `quality_check_result` column
- Gold: sales_by_product, revenue_by_customer, customer_segmentation
- No cross-layer shortcuts
